  Hardened-runtime entitlements for the Developer ID build.
  Intentionally empty: Pigeon is not sandboxed, WKWebView's JIT runs in
  WebKit's own processes, and outgoing network needs no entitlement outside
  the sandbox. Add keys only when a concrete hardened-runtime failure needs one.
-->
